  <metadata>
    <link href="https://baltictrails.eu/en/forest/day/119" />
    <desc>Short out-and-back walking itinerary along the official Baltic Forest Hiking track, section 92. Uses source points 0–72 inclusive, then follows the same path back. The turnaround is chosen for a roughly 5 km total walk; this is a Haiku Routes itinerary, not a separately named official trail. Source: Baltic Trails / Lauku ceļotājs, retrieved 2026-09-05. No geometry interpolation. Elevation unavailable.</desc>
  </metadata>
